  "bodyHash": "5da29c36b3d05735",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>DarkSmithing</h1>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>提供用於鍛造模板的自訂合成配方，適用於下界合金升級與盔甲紋飾。</p>\n<p><em>支援伺服器端安裝。您只需在伺服器上安裝此模組，客戶端無需安裝。</em></p>\n<p>由製作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同一群作者開發（若想體驗完整的 RPG 玩法，請下載 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，享受任務與角色扮演遊戲體驗）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h5>（這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）</h5>\n<h5>不想四處尋找鍛造模板？或是急著為特定甲冑刻上紋飾？那就直接輕鬆合成吧！利用自訂配方製作各種鍛造模板，再將其複製以進行後續的鍛造。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（現已包含 1.21 版本新增的閃電與流動盔甲紋飾鍛造模板）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">內含配方：-</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界合金升級</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哨兵盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">煩擾盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">野性盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海岸盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙丘盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">導航者盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">崛起盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">塑形盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">宿主盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">守衛盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寂靜盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">潮汐盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">豬鼻盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">肋骨盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">眼眸盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建議使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp; 來查看配方。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">想要更多自訂配方嗎？歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbindings\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkBindings</a>，享有超過 100 種提升便利性的自訂配方。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">範例：-</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/897/123/darksmithing-screenshot.png\" width=\"830\" height=\"1600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就取得一台伺服器，與好友一同遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方廣告橫幅 &amp; 使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可獲得 25 元折扣優惠！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
